## Original Content
See how we made AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production.

## Summary
Duolingo has built an agent platform designed to make production-ready AI agents the default. The platform streamlines the process of building, running, and continuously improving agents in a production environment.

## Key Points
- Duolingo's agent platform simplifies the development and deployment of AI agents for production use.
- The platform emphasizes ease of building, running, and enhancing agents in real-world settings.
- It aims to standardize production-ready agent development at Duolingo.


